                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m here at the Capitol to try and stop Trump\u2019s \u201cOne Big Billionaire Bailout.\u201d\n\nThis bill guts Medicaid coverage, adds trillions to the deficit, and gives tax breaks to the ultra wealthy at the expense of America\u2019s working families. https://t.co/RRuJdqPTaQ",
