                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Medicare coverage began on July 1,\n1966. Within a year, 19 million Americans aged 65+ were enrolled.\n\nNow 59 years later, Republicans are enacting cuts that will hurt Medicare\nrecipients and strip healthcare coverage away from millions of Americans.\n\nI\u2019m here in Washington fighting to protect Medicare and Medicaid.",
