                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "More than 80% of Planned Parenthood patients in California rely on Medi-Cal programs for healthcare. Trump\u2019s ugly bill just gutted funding for some of their most essential services like cancer screenings, birth control, & STI treatment. This is dangerous and irresponsible.",
