                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The GOP forced Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Bill on the American people. We now face the largest cut to Medicaid funding in history. Hospitals in my district alone will lose between $1-2 billion in revenue over the next decade. \n\nAmericans don't want hospital closures or higher wait times. https://t.co/Imf1j5mg4X",
