                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "60 years ago today, President Johnson signed Medicare and Medicaid into law, creating a lifeline for millions of Americans. Now, 17 million Americans are going to lose healthcare coverage in the largest cut to Medicaid in history \u2013 all thanks to Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Bill.\n\nhttps://t.co/FsBBmogJol",
