                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In CA-31 alone, 44,000+ people stand to lose healthcare coverage between the Republican cuts to Medi-Cal and their plot to gut the Affordable Care Act. I will never support legislation that robs my constituents of healthcare and raises the costs for everyone else. This Republican healthcare crisis is out of control.",
