                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Unless Republicans pass a bill to protect healthcare, premiums will DOUBLE. \n\nIf the Affordable Care Act tax credits expire, people in our community will see their premiums rise more than $13,000. \n\nPeople can\u2019t afford this. https://t.co/JDjXdEj9Hl",
