                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "PPPSGV, like other @PPFA health centers, are continuing to see anyone who walks through their doors despite being barred from receiving Medi-Cal reimbursements after the passage of the Big Ugly Law. Patients can still get the high-quality healthcare they know and trust. I toured the Baldwin Park health center to thank the selfless providers who continue to provide lifesaving care to our community.",
