                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "While Republicans rip away healthcare, our providers are continuing to serve the needs of our neighbors. I visited a community center in West Covina to discuss what we can do to support patients and providers during the Republican healthcare crisis. Thank you to our tireless healthcare professionals who continue to keep our community safe and healthy.",
